      533.8
    ],
    "text": "I, Harin Fernando, the Minister of Telecommunication, Foreign Employment and Sports in pursuance of powers vested inme under Sections 32(b) and 33 of the Sports Act, No. 25 of 1973 do hereby appoint Dr. (Mrs.) Daminda Aththanayakewith effect from 18.03.2019 in place of Ashen Fernando, a member of the former Interim Committee appointed byGazette Notification No. 2097/49 dated 16.11.2018, until such time a lawful election of the Sri Lanka Aquatic Association,the National Sports Union for Aquatic Sports, is held as a provisional arrangement.",
